      "text": "ECDYSOZOA\n   |\n   +-- CYCLONEURALIA (no legs)\n   |    |\n   |    +-- Nematoda\n   |    +-- Kinorhyncha\n   |\n   +-- PANARTHROPODA (legs)\n        |\n        +-- Onychophora\n        +-- Tardigrada\n        +-- Arthropoda\nNematomorpha Priapulida    (velvet     (water    (next file)\nLoricifera                  worms)     bears)"
    },
