      "text": "DIVERSITY SNAPSHOT:\n  Nematoda:     1,000,000+ estimated species (25,000 described)\n  Arthropoda:   1,100,000+ described species\n  Together:     ~80–90% of all described animal species\n  Tardigrada:   ~1,300 described\n  Onychophora:  ~180 described"
    },
