      "text": "KEY INNOVATION:\n  Rigid cuticle → protection, but limits growth\n  Solution: periodic MOLTING (ecdysis)\n  Hormone control: ecdysteroids\n  Cuticle material: chitin in arthropods, mostly collagen in nematodes\n```"
