      },
      "text": "KEY FEATURES:\n  Pseudocoelomate (coelom NOT lined by peritoneum)\n  ONLY LONGITUDINAL muscles → sinusoidal locomotion\n  No circular muscles → can't shorten body\n  Round cross-section (vs flatworm)\n  Cuticle molted 4× during development\n  Most are dioecious (separate sexes)"
    },
